<p dir="auto">Note that <code>[[</code> is actually a command/program that returns either <code>0</code> (true) or <code>1</code> (false). Any program that obeys the same logic (like all base utils, such as <code>grep(1)</code> or <code>ping(1)</code>) can be used as condition, see examples.</p>
